  "changes": [
    "Warm the initial button, checkbox, text-field, select and loading-indicator static module graphs at app kickoff. Resolve stable tag names through generated export metadata and deduplicate grouped modules.",
    "Reduce the catalog-only Material Symbols font from 349,324 to 137,148 bytes by selecting production literals and conservative catalog tokens instead of test/comment/identifier matches. Preserve all variable axes.",
    "Run the Angular catalog with provideZonelessChangeDetection, omitting the zone.js browser polyfill while retaining tested template and reactive-form event updates.",
    "Make the four Vite catalogs’ remote Roboto stylesheet nonblocking with a CSP-compatible module load handler that covers both stylesheet/entry ordering races.",
    "Keep catalog headings and subtitles on their initial local font to prevent a late Roboto download changing title line counts. Component previews continue to load Roboto."
  ],
